  "Software Details": "软件详情",
  "The Campaign Module allows you to design and launch marketing campaigns without hassle. With its user-friendly interface, you can quickly set up campaign details, including target audience, campaign objectives, and promotional materials. This streamlined process ensures that you can focus on crafting compelling messages and visuals to captivate your audience, rather than getting bogged down in technical details.": "营销活动模块可让您轻松设计和启动营销活动。",
