  "Versatile Promotion Tools": "多功能推广工具",
  "Promoting your campaigns is straightforward with the Campaign Modules versatile promotion tools. Utilize email marketing, social media integrations, and targeted ads to reach your desired audience. You can tailor your promotional efforts to different channels, ensuring that your message resonates with various segments of your customer base. By leveraging these tools, you can maximize your campaigns reach and impact.": "使用活动模块多功能促销工具，可以轻松地促销您的活动。",
  "Organized Campaign Management": "有组织的活动管理",
  "Managing multiple campaigns can be challenging, but the Campaign Module keeps everything organized. The module provides a centralized dashboard where you can monitor the progress of all your campaigns, manage tasks, and track milestones. This organized approach helps you stay on top of deadlines, coordinate team efforts, and ensure that each campaign runs smoothly from start to finish.": "管理多个营销活动可能具有挑战性，但营销活动模块可以使一切井井有条。",
  "Performance Tracking": "绩效追踪",
  "After your campaign concludes, the Campaign Module provides tools to review its performance. Analyze key metrics such as engagement rates, conversion rates, and customer feedback to assess the success of your efforts. Use these insights to identify areas for improvement and optimize future campaigns. By continuously refining your strategies, you can achieve better results and drive your business growth.": "营销活动结束后，营销活动模块会提供用于审查其绩效的工具。",
  "Effective Campaign Marketing Tactics": "有效的活动营销策略",
